WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.380
Hello everybody, my name is Markiplier

00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:03.400
And welcome to Monster Legends

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.160
Now the developer of this game approached me

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:07.240
And asked if I wanted to be paid to promote their game

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:08.380
And I said...

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:10.660
How the fuck did you know i play this game?

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:12.800
It was supposed to be my dirty little secret (Bad Markimoo!)

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:14.620
NO ONE WAS SUPPOSED TO KNOW!

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:15.240
But I said yes

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:17.560
Because, like many other brand deals that I've done in the past...

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:20.500
It affords me the opportunity to donate to charity

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.520
And this time around, we'll be donating $10,000

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:25.360
To the Miracle Foundation

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:27.080
If you don't know about the Miracle Foundation

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:28.380
Please check out the website

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:29.580
I'll provide a link in the description

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:31.320
Along with the PROOF *jingle bells*

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:32.020
Of donation

00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:33.480
By the time you guys are watching this,

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:35.360
The donation has already been made,

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:37.880
So thank you to Social Point Games for allowing that to happen

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:39.560
And thank you guys for watching!

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:40.900
